      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm disappearing. i forgot my sister's birthday yesterday and i couldn't even find my way home from the grocery store. i'm still me, but i can feel the edges of my mind just... fraying. i'm scared of what's coming next. i don't want to be a shell of a person.",
